flowchart TD
    Start([START]) --> CheckSession[Load App & Check Auth Token]
    CheckSession --> IsLoggedIn{Is User Logged In?}
    
    IsLoggedIn -- No --> HasAccount{Has Account?}
    HasAccount -- No --> InputSignUp[/Input Name, Email, Password/]
    InputSignUp --> ValidatePass[Validate Email & Password Strength]
    ValidatePass --> IsSignUpValid{Is Input Valid?}
    IsSignUpValid -- No --> ShowSignUpErr[/Display Validation Error/]
    ShowSignUpErr --> InputSignUp
    IsSignUpValid -- Yes --> DBUsers[(Supabase Auth: auth.users Table)]
    DBUsers --> DBProfiles[(Trigger: public.profiles Table)]
    DBProfiles --> InputLogin[/Input Email & Password/]
    
    HasAccount -- Yes --> InputLogin
    InputLogin --> VerifyAuth[Verify Credentials with auth.users]
    VerifyAuth --> IsAuthValid{Is Auth Valid?}
    IsAuthValid -- No --> ShowAuthErr[/Display Invalid Credentials Error/]
    ShowAuthErr --> InputLogin
    
    IsAuthValid -- Yes --> FetchProfile[Fetch User Stats & XP from public.profiles]
    IsLoggedIn -- Yes --> FetchProfile
    
    FetchProfile --> DisplayDashboard[/Display Main Shell & Dashboard/]
    DisplayDashboard --> IsPracticeMode{Selected Practice Mode?}
    
    IsPracticeMode -- Yes --> IsBalanceScale{Selected Balance Scale?}
    IsBalanceScale -- Yes --> InputScaleOp[/Input Algebraic Operation/]
    InputScaleOp --> CallMathAPI[Send HTTP POST to MathJS / Newton API]
    CallMathAPI --> OutScaleResult[/Display Updated Scale Visual & Step Equation/]
    
    IsBalanceScale -- No --> InputQuizAns[/Input Quiz Answer Choice/]
    InputQuizAns --> CallGeminiAPI[Send Prompt to Google Gemini AI API]
    CallGeminiAPI --> OutQuizFeedback[/Display Score & AI Pedagogical Feedback/]
    
    IsPracticeMode -- No --> IsStudyNotes{Selected Study Notes?}
    IsStudyNotes -- Yes --> IsCreateNote{Create New Note?}
    IsCreateNote -- Yes --> InputNoteData[/Input Note Title and Content/]
    InputNoteData --> DBStudyNotes[(study_notes Table: Insert/Update/Delete)]
    DBStudyNotes --> OutNotesList[/Display Updated Notes List & Details/]
    IsCreateNote -- No --> DBStudyNotes
    
    IsStudyNotes -- No --> PlayLesson[Select Module 1 Lesson & Complete Activity]
    PlayLesson --> UpdateXP[Update XP & Completed Lessons in public.profiles]
    UpdateXP --> OutLessonReward[/Display Lesson Complete Screen & XP Badge/]
    
    OutScaleResult --> IsLogout{Logout of App?}
    OutQuizFeedback --> IsLogout
    OutNotesList --> IsLogout
    OutLessonReward --> IsLogout
    
    IsLogout -- No --> DisplayDashboard
    IsLogout -- Yes --> ClearSession[Clear User Auth Session]
    ClearSession --> End([END])
